{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 261, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n新\n四\n军\n由\n叶\n挺\n负\n责\n等\n问\n题\n致\n叶\n挺\n等\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n \n一 \n.\n \n一\n二\n你\n们\n率\n主\n力\n已\n突\n围\n出\n来\n，\n甚\n慰\n，\n望\n鼓\n励\n士\n气\n，\n坚\n持\n到\n底\n。\n迅\n达\n苏\n南\n，\n军\n中\n一\n切\n由\n希\n夷\n作\n主\n，\n小\n姚\n辅\n \n之\n，\n全\n军\n应\n服\n从\n希\n夷\n命\n令\n。\n重\n庆\n方\n面\n，\n正\n在\n交\n涉\n，\n但\n你\n们\n不\n要\n靠\n望\n，\n一\n切\n靠\n你\n们\n自\n己\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n新\n四\n军\n由\n叶\n挺\n负\n责\n等\n问\n题\n致\n叶\n挺\n等 \n一 \n一\n五\n九\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "efe99c71b0a255440ae98470aaa038eb841c5645d18443c80f83990153a518b9", "text_chars": 362}
