{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 263, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n向\n叶\n挺\n等\n询\n问\n突\n围\n情\n况\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n一 \n•\n二\n二\n \n(\n甲\n)\n闻\n你\n们\n率\n傅\n秋\n涛\n部\n两\n团\n突\n围\n，\n甚\n为\n喜\n慰\n，\n望\n速\n赴\n苏\n南\n。\n(\n乙\n)\n你\n们\n突\n围\n者\n人\n枪\n多\n少\n，\n现\n至\n何\n地\n，\n情\n况\n如\n何\n。\n在\n茂\n林\n被\n围\n者\n人\n枪\n多\n少\n，\n何\n人\n指\n挥\n。\n望\n即\n告\n， \n以\n便\n交\n涉\n。\no\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二\n.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n向\n叶\n挺\n等\n询\n问\n突\n围\n情\n况 \n一 \n一\n六\n一\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "f2f6c60b2cd6a071056cb8b0b5f8e810a0249cae7560f7c6ea6ad951faf24ce9", "text_chars": 320}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 264, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 265, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n应\n向\n国\n民\n党\n \n当\n局\n提\n出\n严\n重\n交\n涉\n致\n周\n恩\n来\n、\n叶\n剑\n英\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n \n一 \n•\n \n二\n二\n希\n夷\n军\n部\n率\n六\n个\n团\n仍\n在\n泾\n县\n以\n南\n茂\n林\n地\n区\n围\n困\n中\n，\n并\n没\n有\n出\n来\n，\n现\n粮\n尽\n弹\n绝\n，\n处\n境\n极\n危\n，\n有\n全\n军\n覆\n \n没\n之\n可\n能\n。\n虽\n有\n傅\n秋\n涛\n两\n个\n团\n突\n出\n至\n宁\n国\n山\n地\n，\n亦\n未\n突\n出\n大\n包\n围\n线\n外\n，\n请\n严\n重\n向\n重\n庆\n提\n出\n交\n涉\n，\n并\n向\n全\n \n国\n呼\n吁\n求\n援\n等\n语\n，\n请\n向\n当\n局\n提\n出\n最\n严\n重\n交\n涉\n，\n如\n不\n立\n即\n解\n围\n，\n我\n们\n即\n刻\n出\n兵\n增\n助\n，\n破\n裂\n之\n责\n由\n彼\n方\n担\n负\n。 \n我\n们\n今\n日\n发\n出\n之\n通\n电\n，\n望\n立\n即\n散\n发\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社\n \n一\n九\n八\n二\n.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n应\n向\n国\n民\n党\n当\n局\n提\n出\n严\n重\n交\n涉\n致\n周\n恩\n来\n、\n叶\n剑\n英 \n一 \n一\n六\n三\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "8bcf61e90d28b00c06899ceda6da056e69adcd9e82a16424034dc0e6265f8ede", "text_chars": 531}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 266, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 267, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n中\n我\n之\n对\n策\n给\n刘\n少\n奇\n、\n陈\n毅\n的\n通\n报\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n \n一 \n•\n \n二\n二\n(\n甲\n)\n我\n们\n已\n向\n当\n局\n提\n出\n最\n严\n重\n之\n抗\n议\n。\n申\n明\n如\n不\n□\n撤\n围\n，\n破\n裂\n之\n责\n在\n彼\n。\n(\n乙\n)\n我\n全\n国\n政\n治\n上\n、\n军\n事\n上\n立\n即\n准\n备\n大\n举\n反\n攻\n。\n(\n丙\n)\n立\n告\n叶\n、\n项\n、\n姚\n诸\n同\n志\n，\n如\n能\n突\n围\n则\n设\n法\n突\n围\n，\n如\n不\n能\n突\n围\n则\n坚\n守\n下\n去\n便\n有\n办\n法\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n中\n我\n之\n对\n策\n给\n刘\n少\n奇\n、\n陈\n毅\n的\n通\n报 \n一 \n一\n六\n五\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "109f986c977648a418b42083bef68aa0ef9ae964cfbf4fa9c49e148da9d18ef7", "text_chars": 402}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 268, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 269, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n在\n苏\n、\n鲁\n \n发\n动\n军\n事\n攻\n势\n以\n答\n复\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n的\n指\n示\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n \n一 \n•\n一\n三\n(\n甲\n)\n同\n意\n刘\n少\n奇\n、\n陈\n毅\n十\n二\n日\n意\n见\n，\n苏\n北\n准\n备\n包\n围\n韩\n德\n勤\n，\n山\n东\n准\n备\n包\n围\n沈\n鸿\n烈\n，\n限\n十\n天\n内\n准\n备\n \n完\n毕\n，\n待\n命\n攻\n击\n。\n山\n东\n由\n朱\n、\n陈\n、\n罗\n负\n责\n，\n苏\n北\n由\n刘\n、\n陈\n负\n责\n。\n以\n答\n复\n蒋\n介\n石\n对\n我\n皖\n南\n一\n万\n人\n之\n聚\n歼\n计\n \n划\no\n(\n乙\n)\n周\n、\n叶\n正\n在\n重\n庆\n抗\n议\n，\n我\n们\n正\n用\n朱\n、\n彭\n、\n叶\n、\n项\n名\n义\n发\n出\n抗\n议\n通\n电\n，\n望\n叶\n、\n项\n电\n达\n茂\n林\n被\n围\n \n部\n队\n，\n如\n无\n法\n突\n围\n，\n应\n再\n坚\n持\n十\n天\n，\n可\n能\n有\n办\n法\n。\n(\n丙\n)\n如\n皖\n南\n部\n队\n被\n蒋\n介\n石\n消\n灭\n，\n我\n应\n坚\n决\n彻\n底\n干\n净\n全\n部\n消\n灭\n韩\n德\n勤\n、\n沈\n鸿\n烈\n，\n彻\n底\n解\n决\n华\n中\n问\n题\n。 \n(\n丁\n)\n为\n应\n付\n严\n重\n事\n变\n，\n华\n北\n准\n备\n机\n动\n部\n队\n应\n加\n紧\n。\n(\n戊\n)\n为\n应\n付\n严\n重\n事\n变\n，\n重\n庆\n、\n桂\n林\n、\n西\n安\n、\n洛\n阳\n各\n办\n事\n处\n，\n应\n即\n刻\n准\n备\n好\n对\n付\n蒋\n介\n石\n袭\n击\n。\n(\n己\n)\n对\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n应\n公\n开\n宣\n传\n，\n对\n消\n灭\n韩\n、\n沈\n部\n署\n应\n绝\n对\n秘\n密\n。\n〇\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n一 \n一\n.\n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n在\n苏\n、\n鲁\n发\n动\n军\n事\n攻\n势\n以\n答\n复\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n的\n指\n示 \n一 \n一\n六\n七\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "f28feb69950844619e8d365e3e4932fbc34b9adb51d5305463bba265bc150d02", "text_chars": 809}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 270, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 271, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n向\n叶\n挺\n等\n询\n问\n \n蒋\n方\n是\n否\n停\n战\n撤\n围\n及\n皖\n南\n新\n四\n军\n情\n况\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n \n一\n二\n四\n(\n一\n)\n蒋\n介\n石\n已\n令\n皖\n南\n停\n战\n撒\n围\n，\n究\n竟\n是\n否\n停\n战\n，\n望\n即\n告\n。\n(\n二\n)\n如\n未\n停\n战\n，\n望\n鼓\n动\n全\n军\n坚\n持\n，\n定\n有\n办\n法\n。\n(\n三\n)\n我\n军\n死\n伤\n多\n少\n，\n被\n俘\n多\n少\n，\n死\n伤\n及\n被\n浮\n干\n部\n姓\n名\n、\n官\n级\n，\n望\n查\n明\n速\n报\n，\n以\n便\n向\n蒋\n交\n涉\n。\n〇\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n向\n叶\n挺\n等\n询\n问\n蒋\n方\n是\n否\n停\n战\n撤\n围\n及\n皖\n南\n新\n四\n军\n情\n况 \n一 \n一\n六\n九\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "97e14d229ac69ee4fd502f190b498233ce31f30542100963bc9dc784e24d6c55", "text_chars": 391}
