{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 273, "text": "持\n关\n于\n同\n蒋\n介\n石\n交\n涉\n情\n况\n给\n叶\n挺\n等\n的\n通\n报\n一\n九\n四\n一\n•\n•\n四\n接\n恩\n来\n报\n告\n称\n：\n「\n蒋\n十\n一 \n一\n日\n、\n十\n三\n日\n两\n次\n电\n令\n顾\n祝\n同\n撤\n围\n，\n并\n允\n走\n苏\n南\n」\n等\n语\n。\n特\n达\n。\n望\n你\n们\n再\n坚\n \n、\n三\n天\n就\n有\n办\n法\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二.\n \n一\n关\n于\n同\n蒋\n介\n石\n交\n涉\n情\n况\n给\n叶\n挺\n等\n的\n通\n报 \n一 \n一\n七\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "d496407ac2cd358fd29b49349a54ed9bde541b86adda77c50ff68d8d07c8c1b3", "text_chars": 255}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 274, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 275, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n周\n恩\n来\n、\n叶\n剑\n英\n \n与\n蒋\n介\n石\n交\n涉\n情\n况\n给\n刘\n少\n奇\n、\n叶\n挺\n等\n的\n通\n报\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n一\n*\n四\n周\n、\n叶\n报\n告\n称\n：\n「\n张\n冲\n昨\n天\n用\n电\n话\n向\n蒋\n报\n我\n们\n对\n围\n攻\n新\n四\n军\n的\n抗\n议\n。\n蒋\n说\n.\n.\n『(\n一\n)\n新\n四\n军\n北\n开\n中\n \n央\n决\n不\n留\n难\n，\n此\n次\n冲\n突\n，\n听\n说\n是\n新\n四\n军\n先\n开\n枪\n。\n(\n二\n)\n希\n望\n新\n四\n军\n继\n续\n向\n北\n开\n。\n(\n三\n)\n如\n此\n路\n不\n通\n，\n转\n \n向\n皖\n北\n开\n亦\n可\n，\n命\n令\n李\n品\n仙\n勿\n留\n难\n。\n(\n四\n)\n我\n已\n下\n令\n新\n四\n军\n过\n江\n后\n发\n弹\n十\n万\n并\n饷\n。\n(\n五\n)\n望\n你\n转\n告\n周\n、 \n叶\n转\n前\n方\n，\n勿\n将\n事\n件\n扩\n大\n。\n』\n我\n现\n直\n函\n蒋\n抗\n议\n，\n并\n坚\n说\n非\n经\n苏\n南\n过\n江\n不\n可\n。\n请\n中\n央\n询\n问\n叶\n、\n项\n，\n究\n竟\n他\n \n们\n采\n取\n那\n条\n道\n路\n折\n进\n苏\n南\n，\n以\n便\n作\n更\n具\n体\n的\n交\n涉\n」\n等\n语\n。\n特\n达\n你\n们\n，\n坚\n持\n数\n日\n，\n便\n有\n办\n法\n。\n〇\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n周\n恩\n来\n、\n叶\n剑\n英\n与\n蒋\n介\n石\n交\n涉\n情\n况\n给\n刘\n少\n奇\n、\n叶\n挺\n等\n的\n通\n报 \n一\n一\n七\n三\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "b344fc0d8412032ef2cfb2b1b29af61f39727f070a3f621e13dfcbf45f5327f3", "text_chars": 680}
