{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 277, "text": "毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n国\n民\n党\n军\n解\n决\n我\n七\n千\n余\n人\n情\n况\n给\n周\n恩\n来\n等\n的\n通\n报\n一\n九\n四\n一 \n•\n一 \n•\n \nI\n四\n确\n息\n：\n上\n官\n云\n相\n十\n三\n日\n未\n时\n解\n决\n我\n七\n千\n余\n人\n，\n另\n有\n千\n余\n人\n已\n命\n坚\n决\n解\n决\n。\nO\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n二\n.\n \n一\n毛\n泽\n东\n、\n朱\n德\n、\n王\n稼\n祥\n关\n于\n国\n民\n党\n军\n解\n决\n我\n七\n千\n余\n人\n情\n况\n给\n周\n恩\n来\n等\n的\n通\n报 \n一 \n一\n七\n五\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "db37f37ec4e6e05f0733c4a66e60aeed38c88424fec2ba66c37e1e8874622e39", "text_chars": 285}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 278, "text": "", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "text_chars": 0}
{"kind": "pdf_page", "number": 279, "text": "关\n于\n向\n蒋\n介\n石\n交\n涉\n立\n即\n停\n战\n撤\n围\n致\n周\n恩\n来\n、\n叶\n剑\n英\n一\n九\n四\n丁\n \n一\n二\n四\n \n(\n一\n)\n十\n三\n日\n报\n告\n悉\n，\n已\n转\n叶\n、\n项\n。\n(\n一\n一\n)\n现\n在\n不\n是\n走\n何\n路\n线\n问\n题\n，\n而\n是\n救\n死\n问\n题\n，\n如\n不\n停\n止\n攻\n击\n，\n即\n将\n全\n军\n覆\n灭\n，\n请\n立\n即\n要\n蒋\n下\n令\n停\n \n战\n撤\n围\n。\n(\n三\n)\n项\n因\n走\n不\n脱\n已\n归\n队\n，\n并\n决\n与\n全\n军\n共\n存\n亡\n。\n(\n四\n)\n突\n围\n者\n是\n傅\n秋\n涛\n两\n个\n团\n，\n亦\n尚\n未\n脱\n离\n大\n包\n围\n，\n叶\n、\n项\n、\n姚\n主\n力\n尚\n在\n茂\n林\n原\n地\n，\n被\n数\n万\n大\n军\n围\n \n攻\n，\n现\n已\n血\n战\n八\n天\n，\n十\n分\n危\n险\n。\no\n皖\n南\n事\n变\n(\n资\n料\n选\n辑\n)\n \n中\n共\n中\n央\n党\n校\n出\n版\n社 \n一\n九\n八\n一 \n一 \n• \n一\n关\n于\n向\n蒋\n介\n石\n交\n涉\n立\n即\n停\n战\n撒\n围\n致\n周\n恩\n来\n、\n叶\n剑\n英 \n二\n七\n七\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-a8fd7b6cee628133d81a", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/pdf/chinese_marxists/mao/1-06.pdf", "source_raw_sha256": "079cc1102643767ff4348274e0c5e10f8c856c7afb10aa8722968af11ca85ec3", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-bujuan-9", "volume": 6, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "2d8b473353f6971151925bd6cfe5662528e8bbed1e3a0b3ffde09e62bc3a3e05", "text_chars": 461}
